The composed migrate-on-read chain for asset-specific-terms payloads — the single entry point that turns "whatever version is stored" into a payload current readers accept:
unstamped (version 0) → stamped via ;
(a cross-family economic-terms document) → flattened v1 via ;
accepted versions pass through unchanged; unknown future versions pass through with their version preserved — acceptance stays the guard's decision, so newer payloads degrade with a precise diagnostic instead of failing in the chain.

One event in an effective corporate action's supersede chain. 
is the stored write-side state (null stored states read as Confirmed);
